tinyephemeris is an independently written MIT implementation from published mathematics.
No reference library source is linked into the runtime.
96 independent SciPy CubicHermiteSpline vector trajectories and derivatives are frozen. Tests check endpoints, invalid/sorted data, out-of-range requests and failure preservation. Scaled component tolerance3e-13, plus1e-9m/s absolute velocity floor. Oracle: https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.interpolate.CubicHermiteSpline.html .
